      "justification": "Epinephrine 1mg IV is indicated in cardiac arrest management per ACLS guidelines. Given that defibrillation, CPR, and amiodarone 300mg have already been administered, repeat epinephrine every 3-5 minutes is standard of care during resuscitation."
    },
